Hi Ross,

Yes, mean() is the function. mean.UD() is R's S3 notation for the UD-object version of mean().

Please see the help file ?mean.UD as the weights are not yet optimized/estimated as with akde(), and have to be specified by the user. That's how I was able to implement this so fast.

Best,
Chris

